<p>Coordinating the same message across surfaces? Compare the professional-card shape on <a href="/image-resizer-for-linkedin/">the LinkedIn link preset</a>, and if the campaign also needs a video cover look at <a href="/image-resizer-for-youtube/">the YouTube thumbnail size</a> before you export.</p>
